    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "100k Studio (legally 100k Studio GmbH) is a small web development and design studio in Berlin, founded by Armin Unruh and Felix Albert (northdata registry lists Unruh as managing director, seat Berlin, GmbH since around 2018). Site copy lists clients Burberry, Adidas, Warp Records, Vice, Warner Music, Soho House and e-flux, and several projects use 3D/WebGL treatments (Burberry Monogram, Adidas Loops), though these claims are unverified beyond their own portfolio. Established, founder-led shop (Armin Unruh has been building sites since at least 2015 per the Lay Theme WordPress theme), reads as an experienced small studio rather than a new one. Org entry, no individual Autonomy set. Instagram (@100k_studio) hit IG's logged-out rate-limit error twice; the profile shot is queued to state/ig-queue.json for a logged-in ig.py pass.",
      "source_url": "https://100k.studio/",
      "verified_at": "2026-07-26T22:33:31",
      "set_by": "agent"
    },
